# Customer Success Story: RetailMax Corporation

## Challenge
RetailMax struggled with inventory management across 500+ retail locations, leading to stockouts and overstock situations.

## Solution
Deployed NexaInsight Platform with AI-powered demand forecasting and real-time inventory tracking.

## Results
- 28% reduction in stockouts
- 15% decrease in excess inventory
- $12M improvement in working capital

